{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38124","headline":"和王舍人抚州饮席赠韦司空 · 韩偓","name":"和王舍人抚州饮席赠韦司空","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼台掩映入春寒，丝竹铮鏦向夜阑。\n席上弟兄皆杞梓，花前宾客尽鸳鸾。\n孙弘莫惜频开合，韩信终期别筑坛。\n削玉风姿官水土，黑头公自古来难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}